3. I undertake that on happening of any one of the following events, I shall forthwith surrender the index card of all of the
members of my family including myself as the case may be:—
(i)
On the death of any family member;
(ii)
On a family member ceasing to be dependent on me and/or reside with me;
(iii)
On my retirement/dismissal/discharge from Government service;
(iv)
On any of the members joining private/government service.
